Package: residencyR
Type: Package
Title: Data Residency Auditing and Compliance Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Lawrence Daniel Garba
Maintainer: Lawrence Daniel Garba <laws.garba@gmail.com>
URL: https://laws2020.github.io/residencyR, https://github.com/laws2020/residencyR
BugReports: https://github.com/laws2020/residencyR/issues
Description: Audits where infrastructure and transaction data physically
    resides, flags offshore exposure, and generates compliance
    certificates against a configurable regulatory citation and
    deadline (defaults to Nigeria's CBN payment data localization
    circular). The audit engine (scanning, classification, ingestion)
    has no dependency beyond base R. Certificate generation is
    commercially licensed and additionally requires 'openssl' for
    signature verification.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    openssl,
    tools
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
